  Construction Paving Over The Crime Scene At UVU Jeopardize Life Or
  Safety Of An Individual?
  To the extent your request seeks such
  records, including correspondence or ap-
  provals from UVU Facilities or DFCM, relating
  to the Orem campus Fountain Courtyard, re-
  sponsive records are attached.
